{"status":"completed","summary":"Built CORP.EXAMPLE with replicated controllers on node1/node2, member file server node3, and joined client node4. DNS, Kerberos, SMB, controller failover, and persistence across sequential restarts were verified.","actions_performed":["Bound Samba identity services to the dedicated enp8s0 network (10.100.242.0/24).","Created engineering and its member infrasetuser.","Published /srv/corp/engineering with welcome.txt containing infraset-samba and verified member write access.","Created node4:/root/corp-user.env with mode 0600.","Tested service availability with each controller stopped separately.","Restarted node1, node2, node3, and node4 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Replicated CORP.EXAMPLE controllers on the identity network","command_ids":["cmd-78a5c8c2d97f40f1","cmd-121431e1268b4f32","cmd-2579f708126540ee","cmd-62775fa61fd848ee"],"summary":"Shows domain provisioning, node2 DC join, dedicated-interface binding, active services, DNS records, and successful final replication."},{"requirement":"Engineering group and infrasetuser membership","command_ids":["cmd-7f1eb4eb4c8d4bfa"],"summary":"Shows group/user creation, enabled account, and membership."},{"requirement":"Member server, share content, permissions, and write access","command_ids":["cmd-973089f655ab4c37","cmd-f11f5fbc067042cc","cmd-f9a14eee77094464"],"summary":"Shows node3 joined, the share configuration, authenticated read/write, correct ownership/modes, and persistent welcome.txt content."},{"requirement":"Joined client and protected credential environment file","command_ids":["cmd-284953fc51b6491b","cmd-754a741b29a446c4"],"summary":"Shows node4 joined, Winbind/NETLOGON healthy, SAMBA_USER present, SAMBA_PASSWORD present without disclosure, file mode 0600, and authenticated share access."},{"requirement":"Availability while node1 is down","command_ids":["cmd-f9b22c94824b4fea","cmd-251484d72ade44eb","cmd-0ce8710bb97c48e1","cmd-9e80b7c373ba45e0","cmd-409d2806117745f7"],"summary":"Proves node1 stopped, node2 served DNS/AD, node3 switched NETLOGON to node2, and node4 obtained Kerberos credentials and wrote the share before node1 recovered."},{"requirement":"Availability while node2 is down","command_ids":["cmd-df97c753980c4dae","cmd-2a3b435f6a034a88","cmd-e97cd5ff0f7b4b90","cmd-1fc9cae2c29d4314"],"summary":"Proves node2 stopped, node1 served DNS/Kerberos, and node4 read and wrote the share before node2 recovered."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-1c6adac5276a4120","cmd-e2a0856289c344b3","cmd-e5f1c346590a4533","cmd-45c6b4d6f56d4dbd"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot 8e0ddb92…, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot 0109c25c…, then recovered AD, DNS, identities, and replication."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-683d4d6c962a4e19","cmd-c0e83c855047491c","cmd-b966ac1568c14bc9","cmd-6426c996247a454c"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot e5bd5a63…, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot 1b2d0150…, then recovered AD, DNS, identities, and replication."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-c255e80c2e9f4964","cmd-1549b79a85154f91","cmd-93f78b58638b4576","cmd-39b7b4d6dcb84e8a","cmd-6332e3a6847f4ac6"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot 6693787a…, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot 3b2ef616…, recovered join/listener/data, followed by remote authenticated read/write."},{"requirement":"node4 restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-6332e3a6847f4ac6","cmd-54e1aed37cf34a47","cmd-559d0abe3cd9425d","cmd-13a7b45db4944f59"],"summary":"Healthy baseline boot 872e8664…, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot 7cfe7399…, then recovered join, credentials, DNS, Kerberos, and authenticated SMB read/write."}]}
